<title>USA: Benthos names Dunne CFO.</title>
<headline>Benthos names Dunne CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH FALMOUTH, Mass. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benthos Inc said Francis Dunne Jr has been appointed chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Dunne is a certified public accountant and former CFO of Kinney Vacuum Co, a unit of General Signal Corp.</p>
